.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE TRANSITION"
.SH NAME
hamstik release transition \- Transition a release to a target state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release transition [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Transition a release to a target state
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Release version id (UUID)
.TP
.I TARGET
Target state
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --confirm-incomplete-scope
Confirm releasing a scope that still contains incomplete Work Items
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the release moved
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
